{'symbol': 'PBCT', 'date': '2021-04-22 16:30:00', 'title': "PEOPLE'S UNITED FINANCIAL DECLARES CASH DIVIDEND ON PREFERRED STOCK", 'text': "BRIDGEPORT, CONN., APRIL 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PEOPLE'S UNITED FINANCIAL, INC. (NASDAQ: PBCT) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.3515625 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S FIXED-TO-FLOATING RATE NON-CUMULATIVE PERPETUAL PREFERRED STOCK."}